#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. off = the game's own picture: use it to compare. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = puhtad servad mängu renderdussuuruses. DLSS = sama, ning skaleerib üles, kui mängu Scaling "
"on alla 100 %. väljas = mängu enda pilt: võrdlemiseks. Salvestub kohe."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your GPU. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, half-size see-through "
"depth, flat mirrors without part motion, lighter part-motion search. low = also no mirror DLAA, "
"no see-through depth, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Eelseaded sinu GPU jaoks. kõrge = kõik sees (mudel 1). keskmine = mudel 2, poole suurune "
"läbipaistvuse sügavus, lamedad peeglid ilma osade liikumiseta, kergem liikumisotsing. madal = ka "
"peeglitel DLAA-d ei ole, läbipaistvuse sügavust ei ole, VR-ala 60 %. Ei muuda sinu enda seatut."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, least ghosting "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = kõige rohkem detaili, teravaim tekst, umbes 1,6x GPU koormus võrreldes 2-ga. 2 (E) = "
"tasakaalus, vähim kummitus liikluse taga: alusta siit. 3 (F) = rahulikum aedadel ja juhtmetel, "
"võib liikuvat detaili määrida, hind nagu 2. 4 (M) = raskeim (umbes 5x), ainult lamedale."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the DLAA area and the see-through depth. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Pildikvaliteet: teritus, tekstuuri teravus, DLAA ala ja läbipaistvuse sügavus. Parem avab rühma, "
"vasak sulgeb; menüü avamisel on see alati suletud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Teritab pilti pärast DLAA-d, 0 (väljas) kuni 1.0. Tõsta, kui pilt on pehme; liiga suur annab "
"servadele heledaid sõrmuseid. Maksab umbes 0,1 ms; 0 jätab sammu vahele."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Teritamise ulatus, 1 kuni 4 px: väike = peen detail, suur = jämedamad servad. Muuda, kui teritus "
"on liiga peen või jäme; ekraanist suuremana joonistatud pilt, nagu VR-is, vajab üle 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. No GPU time, only a little memory bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Teravam tekstuuritekst (liiklusmärgid, armatuurlaud, GPS). 0 = väljas; mida negatiivsem, seda "
"teravam, aga aiad värelevad rohkem; proovi -0.5 kuni -1, kui tekst on udune. Ei võta GPU aega, "
"ainult veidi mälu ribalaiust."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaf cut-outs: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it "
"if grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Acts only while Texture sharpness is not 0. No "
"GPU time, a little memory."
msgstr ""
"Sama traataedadele, murule ja lehtede väljalõigetele: tõsta 0 poole, kui aiad värelevad, langeta, "
"kui muru on pehme. sama = järgib ülemist rida. Toimib ainult kui Tekstuuri teravus pole 0. Ei "
"võta GPU aega, veidi mälu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: DLAA saab ainult iga silma keskosa (20 kuni 100 %); serv jääb mängu pildiks. Vähenda, et "
"lubada raskemat mudelit või rohkem fps-i; 40 % maksab umbes 40 % mudelist. Seab ka garaaži / "
"peamenüü veoki."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA before the game's bloom / tonemap, so lane paint, wires and rails shimmer less. "
"Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscale or Windows HDR. Same cost either way; takes "
"~60 frames to switch."
msgstr ""
"Ainult lame: DLAA enne mängu bloomi / tonemapi, nii värelevad teemarkeering, juhtmed ja rööpad "
"vähem. Muuda ainult võrdluseks. Ei kasutata DLSS skaleerimise ega Windows HDR-iga. Sama hind; "
"ümberlülitus võtab ~60 kaadrit."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives wires, fences and glass their own distance instead of what is behind them, so they do not "
"smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Annab juhtmetele, aedadele ja klaasile oma kauguse tausta asemel, et need liikudes ei määriks. "
"Lülita välja, kui määrimist ei näe: säästab 0,02 - 0,06 ms silma kohta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: DLSS takes each "
"glow from the current frame, not its history. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp glows flicker, 0 = "
"off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Takistab tänavalampide ja autotulede hõõgumisel jälge jätmast liikudes: DLSS võtab hõõgumise "
"praegusest kaadrist, mitte ajaloost. 25 % sammuga; vähenda, kui lambihõõgus väreleb, 0 = väljas. "
"Maksab umbes 0,05 - 0,2 ms silma kohta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kuidas DLAA käsitleb liikuvaid osi ja veoki peegleid. Parem avab rühma, vasak sulgeb; menüü "
"avamisel on see alati suletud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives each moving part (traffic, wheels, plates) its own motion for DLAA, so it stays sharp and "
"does not ghost. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: every pixel then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"Annab igale liikuvale osale (liiklus, rattad, numbrimärgid) DLAA jaoks oma liikumise, et see "
"jääks terav ja ei kummitaks. Lülita välja ainult ~0,5 ms säästmiseks silma kohta või testiks: "
"siis liigub iga piksel kaameraga ja liiklus määrib."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives truck mirrors their own DLAA so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can ghost "
"in the glass; else each part moves exactly in the glass."
msgstr ""
"Annab veoki peeglitele oma DLAA, et need ei väreleks. 1 peegel = ainult suurim (peamine peegel "
"sinu kõrval). kõik = kõik peeglid. kaamera = odavaim peegli kohta, liikuv liiklus võib klaasis "
"kummitada; muidu liigub iga osa klaasis täpselt."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"sees = iga peegel saab DLAA iga 2. kaadri tagant ja vahepeal näitab oma viimast puhast pilti: "
"umbes pool peegli hinnast. Servad jäävad puhtaks; liikuv klaasis uueneb poole sagedusega. väljas "
"= iga peegel iga kaader."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires keep their motion while you drive: DLAA spreads the motion data over thin lines (DLSS "
"motion dilation). on = default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is "
"soft for a moment when it changes."
msgstr ""
"Õhukesed juhtmed säilitavad liikumise sõidu ajal: DLAA laotab liikumisandmed õhukestele joontele "
"(DLSS motion dilation). sees = vaikimisi. väljas = ainult võrdluseks; lähedased juhtmed värelevad "
"rohkem. Pilt on ümberlülitamisel hetke pehme."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires get depth on every pixel they touch, not only where they cover a pixel centre. on = "
"default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Õhukesed juhtmed saavad sügavuse igale puudutatud pikslile, mitte ainult kus katavad piksli "
"keskpunkti. sees = vaikimisi. sees (no A2C) = ka läbipaistvatele servadele. väljas = ainult "
"võrdluseks; lähedased juhtmed värelevad rohkem."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Katseline: joonistab kaugeid alla 1 piksli õhukesi juhtmeid 1 piksli joonena, et need ei katkeks "
"kriipsudeks. Vaikimisi väljas: kauged juhtmed võivad tunduda tumedamad või värelda rohkem. Proovi "
"ja võrdle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS upscale, the DLAA on / off switch and the OFXR Bridge / VectorXR info. Right opens the "
"group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"DLSS skaleerimine, DLAA sisse / välja lüliti ja OFXR Bridge / VectorXR info. Parem avab rühma, "
"vasak sulgeb; menüü avamisel on see alati suletud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS draws the picture back up to full size when the game's Scaling is below 100 %: sharper than "
"the game's own stretch, and fewer pixels drawn means more fps. No extra cost; does nothing at "
"Scaling 100 %."
msgstr ""
"DLSS joonistab pildi tagasi täissuuruseks, kui mängu Scaling on alla 100 %: teravam kui mängu "
"enda venitus ja vähem pikslit tähendab rohkem fps-i. Lisakulu pole; Scaling 100 % juures ei tee "
"midagi."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Lülitab kogu modi sisse või välja ja jätab režiimi meelde; väljas näitab mängu enda pilti "
"võrdluseks. Väljas säästab kõigi osade hinna korraga."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR kaadrigeneraator (djules75), eraldi allalaadimine "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). leitud = selle kiht on selles mängus laaditud ja mod laseb "
"selle töö läbi. Käivita selle tray-rakendus enne mängu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = OpenXR täiendus (DienerTech) (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, Depth, "
"kaadrigeneraator; leitud = selle kiht on mängus laaditud ja mod laseb selle töö läbi. Kasuta "
"ainult ühte Turbot (selle või modi oma)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering and the hidden area mask. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"VR kiirendused: Turbo, foveated renderdus ja peidetud ala mask. Parem avab rühma, vasak sulgeb; "
"menüü avamisel on see alati suletud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo: no ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojection. VR only. On = the game stops waiting for "
"the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy cities, traffic). Turn it "
"off if the picture judders. From OpenXR Toolkit."
msgstr ""
"Turbo: ei ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojektsiooni. Ainult VR. Sees = mäng ei oota iga "
"kaader peakomplekti: rohkem fps-i ainult kui CPU piirab (tihedad linnad, liiklus). Lülita välja, "
"kui pilt hakib. OpenXR Toolkitist."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring is shaded once per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Terav keskosa, madalam detail serval (ainult NVIDIA RTX). Säästab GPU aega kõrge Scalingu juures. "
"Ainult VR. Välimine ring varjutatakse kord 2 x 2 piksli kohta; aiad, muru ja lehed säilitavad "
"täisdetaili. Lülita välja, kui serv paistab ruudukujuline."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the view "
"sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Foveated (VRS) terava keskosa suurus, 10 - 100 % sammuga 5 %: suurem = rohkem pilti terav, vähem "
"kokkuhoidu; väiksem = rohkem kokkuhoidu, madalam detail algab keskmele lähemal. 80 % (tasakaalus) "
"on vaikimisi; 90 = lai, 65 = kitsas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's passes Foveated (VRS) acts on. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + "
"lighting = also the game's lighting pass, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for "
"blocky light or shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Millistele mängu läbikäikudele Foveated (VRS) mõjub. stseen = ainult 3D maailm (vaikimisi). "
"stseen + valgustus = ka valgustuse läbikäik, ainult kõige servas: rohkem kokkuhoidu. Testi: vaata "
"ruudulisi valgus- või varjuservi vaate küljel."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated (VRS) is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Kui jäme on Foveated (VRS) välimine ring. Tavaline = 1 värv 2 x 2 piksli kohta (vaikimisi). Tugev "
"= 4 x 2, Maks = 4 x 4: rohkem GPU kokkuhoidu, ruudulisemad servad. Parim silmaseirega, kus sa "
"välimist ringi ei vaata."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) follows your eyes on a headset with eye tracking "
"(OpenXR eye gaze, for example Varjo); without one it stays at the lens centre. Needs Foveated "
"(VRS) on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Katseline. Foveated (VRS) terav keskosa järgib silmi silmaseirega peakomplektil (OpenXR eye gaze, "
"nt Varjo); ilma selleta jääb läätse keskele. Vajab Foveated (VRS) sees mängu alguses, muidu "
"taaskäivitust. Peaaegu tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR. Mäng jätab vahele läätse nurgad, mida sa ei näe (peakomplekt teatab need), joonistab "
"vähem pikslit: rohkem GPU varu, pilt jääb samaks. Esimene sisselülitus vajab mängu taaskäivitust. "
"Lülita välja, kui vaate serv paistab vale."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate limits and CPU: NVIDIA Reflex and an FPS cap for flat, a VR FPS cap, CPU tuning. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kaadrisageduse piirid ja CPU: NVIDIA Reflex ja FPS-piir lamedale, VR FPS-piir, CPU häälestus. "
"Parem avab rühma, vasak sulgeb; menüü avamisel on see alati suletud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only. On = the game's frames wait less in the GPU queue: less input lag when "
"the GPU is the limit. Boost also keeps the GPU clocks up. Same fps; small cost. Not used in VR."
msgstr ""
"Ainult lame, ainult NVIDIA. Sees = mängu kaadrid ootavad GPU järjekorras vähem: väiksem "
"sisendviivitus, kui GPU piirab. Boost hoiab ka GPU taktid üleval. Sama fps; väike hind. Ei "
"kasutata VR-is."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Reflex on, the NVIDIA driver does the "
"limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Ainult lame. Hoiab mängu kuni selle kaadrisageduseni: ühtlane kaadriaeg, vähem kuumust ja voolu. "
"Sea veidi alla selle, mida sinu PC tihedas linnas hoiab. Reflexi korral piirab NVIDIA draiver. "
"väljas = piiranguta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's reprojection (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it when "
"the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR. pool = mäng joonistab iga 2. peakomplekti kaadri (72 Hz -> 36 fps), kolmandik = iga "
"3.; peakomplekti reprojektsioon (ASW / Motion Smoothing) täidab ülejäänu ühtlase rütmiga. Kasuta, "
"kui fps kõigub. Lülitab Turbo välja."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together: the main and render thread prefer the P-cores (Intel hybrid CPUs "
"only), the game runs at Above normal priority, and Windows may not throttle it (EcoQoS) or ignore "
"its timer requests. Helps when the CPU is the limit; no cost. Separate settings in dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Kolm CPU lülitit koos: peaning renderlõim eelistavad P-tuumi (ainult Inteli hübriid-CPU-d), mäng "
"töötab Above normal prioriteediga ja Windows ei tohi seda piirata (EcoQoS) ega ignoreerida selle "
"taimeripäringuid. Aitab, kui CPU piirab; tasuta. Eraldi seaded dlaa.ini-s: cpu_pcore, "
"cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Paneeli asukoht, suurus, sügavus, suund ja menüü klahvid. Parem avab rühma, vasak sulgeb; menüü "
"avamisel on see alati suletud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR. Järgi pead = paneel liigub peakomplektiga. Kabiinis fikseeritud = jääb ühele kohale "
"istme ees, püsib vaadates ringi; X / Y / sügavus seavad selle koha (kraadid, meetrid). Vajab VR "
"kihti (vaikimisi). Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Liigutab paneeli külgsuunas, % ekraanist (VR fixed in cab: kraadid ümber istme). Lame ja VR "
"jätavad oma asukoha meelde. Kasuta, kui paneel katab vajaliku. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Liigutab paneeli üles / alla, % ekraanist (VR fixed in cab: kraadid, pluss = alla). Lame ja VR "
"jätavad oma asukoha meelde. Kasuta, kui paneel katab vajaliku. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Teeb paneeli suuremaks või väiksemaks. Tõsta, kui ei saa lugeda, vähenda, kui katab liiga palju. "
"Lame ja VR jätavad oma suuruse meelde. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, seetõttu lamedas hall. Kui kaugel paneel hõljub: meetrites (0.30 - 3.00) VR kihina, "
"vaikimisi; pikslites sissepoole nihkena silma kohta, kui menu_vr_layer = 0. Sama suurus igal "
"sügavusel. Muuda, kui paneeli vaatamine väsitab. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, seetõttu lamedas hall. Sees = paneel pöördub su poole, kui liigutad selle küljele, "
"sama suurus igast nurgast (VR kihina, vaikimisi, ka peaga kaasa liikuv fps-kast); väljas = lame "
"pilt. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR). Use it to see "
"what a setting gains. Its GPU cost is measured: per frame, every picture it is drawn into; none "
"when off. Save keeps it for the next start."
msgstr ""
"Väike reaalaja fps- ja kaadriaja kast, ka kui menüü on suletud (lame ja VR). Kasuta, et näha, "
"mida seade annab. GPU hind mõõdetakse: kaadri kohta, igasse pilti kuhu see joonistatakse; väljas "
"pole midagi. Salvestus jätab selle järgmiseks käivituseks."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"FPS-kasti lukk, asukoht, suurus, värv, VR kaugus ja pööre. Parem avab rühma, vasak sulgeb; menüü "
"avamisel on see alati suletud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + "
"Per-part motion vectors). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR. Järgi pead = liigub peakomplektiga. Ruumis fikseeritud = üks koht ümber istme, ei "
"järgi kabiini kõikumist. Sõidukiga seotud = kinni kabiinis, kõigub sellega (vajab DLAA + Osade "
"liikumisvektorid). Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, Sõidukiga seotud. Sees = iga veok / auto jätab oma fps-kasti koha kabiinis, pöörde, "
"suuruse, värvi, heleduse ja teksti meelde (salvestub dlaa.ini-sse menüü sulgemisel). Väljas = üks "
"ühine komplekt kõigile sõidukitele. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, Sõidukiga seotud. Parem = mõõda kabiin uuesti (istu paigal, pargitud), kui kast on "
"valel kohal. Vasak = selle sõiduki kast vaikeseadele (koht, pööre, suurus, värv, tekst); teised "
"sõidukid jätavad omad. Kast on kabiiniga risti."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Liigutab fps-kasti külgsuunas, % ekraanist (VR fixed / attached: kraadid ümber sinu). Lame ja VR "
"jätavad oma asukoha meelde. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Liigutab fps-kasti üles / alla, % ekraanist (VR fixed / attached: kraadid, miinus = üles). Lame "
"ja VR jätavad oma asukoha meelde. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, seetõttu lamedas hall. Pöörab fps-kasti vasakule / paremale, kraadides (+ = nägu "
"pöörab paremale). Kasuta kasti nurgutamiseks, kui see on küljel. 0 = nägu sinu poole. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, seetõttu lamedas hall. Kallutab fps-kasti, kraadides (+ = ülaserv kaldub sinust "
"eemale, nagu lebaks armatuuril). 0 = nägu sinu poole. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, seetõttu lamedas hall. Pöörab fps-kasti oma tasapinnas, kraadides (+ = päripäeva). 0 = "
"püsti. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Teeb fps-kasti suuremaks või väiksemaks (0.2 .. 3.0). Tõsta, kui ei saa peakomplektis või suurel "
"ekraanil lugeda. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Fps-kasti teksti värv: 20 värvi, igaühel kontuur, et see oleks igal pildil loetav (black on white "
"= tume tekst, valge kontuur). Lame ja VR. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Fps-kasti heledus, 10 - 100 %: 100 = värv nagu on, madalam tuhmistab teksti (kontuur jääb) musta "
"poole. Kasuta näidiku vaigistamiseks öösel või peakomplektis. Lame ja VR. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kui läbipaistev on kogu fps-kast, 10 - 100 %: 100 = täiesti läbipaistmatu, madalam hajutab teksti "
"JA musta kontuuri koos, et tuhm kast ei muutuks mustaks plekiks. Lame ja VR. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ainult VR, seetõttu lamedas hall. Kui kaugel fps-kast hõljub, 0.30 - 3.00 m. See jääb vaates "
"samasuureks igal kaugusel; muutub ainult sügavus. Pane lähedale sügavusele, mida vaatad, et "
"lugeda ilma uuesti teravustamata. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics, and debug also runs "
"the GPU timers and the CPU profiler."
msgstr ""
"Mis läheb faili dlaa_inject.log: väljas = mitte midagi; vead = ainult tõrked (vaikimisi); "
"hoiatused = + möödaviidud probleemid; info = + käivitus ja muudatused; silumine = + statistika, "
"ja silumine käivitab ka GPU taimerid ja CPU profileerija."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Selle menüü keel. auto = mängu keel (vaikimisi); vasak / parem valib teise. Linux / Proton: "
"hiina, jaapani ja korea keel vajavad fonte, vt README. DLL-i kõrval olev lang\\<code>.po võidab, "
"sinu enda parandusteks. Salvestus jätab selle. Tasuta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Selle menüü kõik kiirklahvid, rida toimingu kohta, klaviatuuri klahv ja kontrolleri nupp. Parem "
"avab loendi; vali toiming paremaga, siis vajuta uut klahvi või rooli nuppu. Salvestub kohe "
"dlaa.ini-sse."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Kirjutab kõik siin näidatu dlaa.ini-sse (seaded ning paneeli / fps-kasti asukohad, kui oled neid "
"liigutanud), säilitades kõik teised read. Tee seda, kui meeldib, mida näed, muidu kaovad "
"muudatused järgmisel käivitusel. Režiim salvestub ise."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, profile, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, logging), live "
"and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Seab kõik selle menüü seaded tagasi modi tarneseisu (mudel, teritus, tekstuuri teravus, DLAA ala, "
"liikumine, peeglid, profiil, paneel, fps-kast, turbo, foveated, kaadrisagedus, logi), reaalajas "
"ja dlaa.ini-s, säilitades kiirklahvid ja kõik teised read."

